X: 1
T: Sominex
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The sleeping-pill commercial jingle from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody
N: (channel 0) of a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7955), key G minor and octave as in the
N: source; chords fitted from the accompaniment (Gm7 vamp with Cm7 answers and a
N: D7 turn). The jingle's light sixteenth pushes are straightened to the eighth;
N: pitches are the source's. Scope: the jingle whole (source bars 8-20); the F#
N: of the last bar is the source's leading tone.
